  "why_this_one": "The classifier on gain-map crops (ML-29 P10, adopted by the owner 2026-11-18, ADR 0041), the segmenter xl0_v7r_s123 kept: exp290 (seed 123), the best val of exp289-291, augmented head, val macro-F1 0.9574, test 0.9559. Over seeds 42/123/7 against exp286-288 (the same recipe on the same pool without gain maps): test -0.0009 (range -0.0032 .. +0.0031), val -0.0051 (range -0.0094 .. +0.0006), D16's bar not met; analysis/ml29/compare_289_291.txt and p10_compare.txt. exp290 trained on outputs/ml29_p10/segcropped/pool, a scratch pool (its config.json); this card names data/segcropped/pool, whose tree (dff5c24c) is that pool's since the store's re-run with gain maps (ML-29 P11). Shipped for the owner's go-ahead before any release (D15).",
