    "tta": false,
    "why": "No dihedral TTA: 8 views x 40 patches is ~46 s per photo for ViT-B/16 on the production VM (docs/dinov3_integration_plan.md \u00a76.2), and TTA for the frozen head is unmeasured (Screen D). Without it, model time is ~5.8 s per photo at 4 threads, parity with the retired ResNet18 + TTA."
